From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:32:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: cctest test-jump-threading adaptation for 46c1404 (test
 only)

The 3.1.4 patch for 46c1404 (crbug 581561827) removed the
frame_at_start parameter of JumpThreading::ComputeForwarding but not
its cctest change, so test-jump-threading.cc did not compile. Add the
upstream test change (byte-identical to 15.6.75.76). No change to d8
or the browser.
---
 patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md                      | 10 ++++++++++
 ...st-cctest-compiler-test-jump-threading.cc.patch | 14 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 24 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/v8/test-cctest-compiler-test-jump-threading.cc.patch

diff --git a/patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md b/patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md
index b5ae3e9..74f5988 100644
--- a/patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md
+++ b/patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+# FlyWeb 3.2.1: cctest adaptation for 46c1404 (test only)
+
+SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33, 21-11-2026 (softmac `FlyWeb/seguridad/siguiente/brave-core/0003`; asked by COORDINACIÓN-58 after
+D8-LINUX-5 found it). The 3.1.4 patch for **46c1404** (581561827) removed the `frame_at_start` parameter of
+`JumpThreading::ComputeForwarding` but left out its cctest change, so `test/cctest/compiler/test-jump-threading.cc`
+did not compile. This adds that change: the call in `VerifyForwarding` drops the last argument. Applied to 15.6.75.66
+the file is byte-identical to upstream 15.6.75.76. Test code only: no change to d8 or the browser, no cache epoch.
+
+To check (D8-LINUX): cctest builds; `cctest/test-jump-threading/*`.
+
 # FlyWeb 3.2.1: cache epoch
 
 SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33, 21-11-2026 (softmac `FlyWeb/seguridad/siguiente/brave-core/0002`, same pattern as MOTOR-47's
diff --git a/patches/v8/test-cctest-compiler-test-jump-threading.cc.patch b/patches/v8/test-cctest-compiler-test-jump-threading.cc.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5fc2aec
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/v8/test-cctest-compiler-test-jump-threading.cc.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+diff --git a/test/cctest/compiler/test-jump-threading.cc b/test/cctest/compiler/test-jump-threading.cc
+index bc0dc1c500a2946c8717fd5a8905c14ba5e63f07..3a22c7e7dc2137a5acd21337a6ef9364df8fc82f 100644
+--- a/test/cctest/compiler/test-jump-threading.cc
++++ b/test/cctest/compiler/test-jump-threading.cc
+@@ -161,8 +161,7 @@ void VerifyForwarding(TestCode* code, int count, int* expected) {
+   v8::internal::AccountingAllocator allocator;
+   Zone local_zone(&allocator, ZONE_NAME);
+   ZoneVector<RpoNumber> result(&local_zone);
+-  JumpThreading::ComputeForwarding(&local_zone, &result, &code->sequence_,
+-                                   true);
++  JumpThreading::ComputeForwarding(&local_zone, &result, &code->sequence_);
+ 
+   CHECK(count == static_cast<int>(result.size()));
+   for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
